+## Deploy on Wasmer
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-6B4EFF)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=streamlit%2Fstreamlit-example)
+
+[Wasmer Edge](https://wasmer.io) detects Streamlit from `requirements.txt`, installs it and runs `streamlit run streamlit_app.py`; no extra config is needed. The button deploys this repository as-is and does not fork it. To deploy your edited copy, fork this repo and connect your fork from the Wasmer dashboard (or change `streamlit%2Fstreamlit-example` in the link above to your `user%2Frepo`).
